        "e": "2026-08-28T04:00:00+01:00",
        "d": "Label head Michael Lundy explores Rap Vacation’s experimental influences, with guests and exclusive cuts from the thriving LA beat scene.\nFrom the host: \"Saigon State of Mind is a 33-track mix featuring pre-1975 Vietnamese music and samples, and a variety of beats by modern Vietnamese artists.\"\n\"Compiled, arranged, and mixed by Citizen Ten - a San Francisco-based Vietnamese-American DJ who also serves as the Executive Producer of the award nominated documentary, \"Y Vân: The Lost Sounds of Saigon\" which tells the epic story of Y Vân, a legendary Vietnamese composer, and his granddaughter Khoa as she journeys to uncover and preserve his lost music.\"",
